oting could still consolidate Republican support in later rounds.\n\nKreiss-Tomkins has raised more than twice what the Republican candidates combined, and recent surveys from Alaska Survey Research, Siena College, and Cygnal show him ahead. Expert forecasters split between tossup and Lean Democratic, with several moving the race toward Democrats in October, and prediction markets price him around an 80 percent favorite. The state's Republican lean and relatively thin polling leave meaningful uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6825, "margin": 2.46}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7335, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7395, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7331, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.7068, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7071, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7313, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7365, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.7094, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7204, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.7496, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.7614, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7619, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.7414, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.7753, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.7728, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.7882, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.7784, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.7949, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.8004, "margin": 5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7839, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.7591, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.7654, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.7464, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.7725, "margin": 4.5}]}